Hospital teams

The group `Ward` holds `Nurse station` and `Bedside monitor`. The
`Bedside monitor` sends to the `Nurse station`, with the label `alarm`. The
`Nurse station` writes to `Records`, with the label `write`. The team `Nursing`
owns the `Ward`, and the team `IT` owns `Records`, with the key `owner`. Show
the seams by owner.
---
Ward { Nurse station, Bedside monitor }
Ward { owner: Nursing }
Records { owner: IT }
Bedside monitor -> Nurse station: alarm
Nurse station -> Records: write
show seams by owner
